name: roaming_partner_traffic
description: "DEMO 1 — Revenue assurance: which partner operators exchange roaming traffic, how much, and where the charges look wrong. Links fold TAP records per (visited, home, event type, settlement status); width = record count. Use Advanced search for Σ CHARGE_SDR per pair — the Northwind Mobile → Aurora Telecom GPRS link is billed at 3.2× the agreed rate — and look for the Quartz↔Fjord backbone (Flow & backbone, Cut points)."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: circular
profile: telecom
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: roaming_tap_dataset
    sourceCol: SENDER_NAME
    targetCol: RECIPIENT_NAME
    linkKindCol: EVENT_TYPE
    attrCols[1]: SETTLEMENT_STATUS
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
